## Monitoring

Per subtask:

- `slay tasks view <subtask-id>` — current status, any notes added by the agent.
- `slay pty status <subtask-id>` — PTY state (attention / busy / idle).
- `slay pty tail <subtask-id>` — latest output (use sparingly; prefer the agent's structured updates).

Cadence:
- Poll each active subtask every ~15 minutes while busy, or when the PTY returns to `attention`.
- Don't interrupt an agent mid-work. If the PTY is in `attention` state, it's waiting — read its last message, respond if needed.

